# Windows scripts must be stored as CRLF in the repo.
# GitHub "Download ZIP" / raw blobs serve the committed bytes as-is.
# `text eol=crlf` only converts on git checkout — ZIP users still get LF,
# and cmd.exe then fails (merges lines, runs embedded PowerShell as batch).
*.cmd -text
*.bat -text
*.ps1 -text
*.vbs -text
*.wsf -text
*.reg -text
